# ...except the supplementary clips, which README.md, the licence table and
# paper/videos/README.md all promise the reader. 33 files, ~16 MB: the paper's
# 31-clip inventory plus the two teleop session recordings that are not part of
# it. Each is a render of the evaluation itself, driven by the same harness that
# produced the corresponding table, so a clip cannot drift from its number.
!paper/videos/*.mp4

